      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tn.gov/environment/program-areas/na-natural-areas/natural-areas-east-region/east-region-/na-na-falling-water-falls.html",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The gorge stays damp year‑round, mist from the falls keeping the forest moist and cool.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
