      ],
      "source": "https://www.tn.gov/environment/program-areas/na-natural-areas/natural-areas-east-region/east-region-/na-na-falling-water-falls.html",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Steep, rugged cliffs rise sharply, creating a dramatic contrast with the lush Falling Water Falls Gorge.",
